
### 1. USER - GET cars (очікуємо 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/cars
Authorization: Basic user user123

### 2. USER - POST car (очікуємо 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8080/cars
Authorization: Basic user user123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Honda",
  "model": "Civic",
  "year": 2023
}

### 3. ADMIN - GET cars (очікуємо 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/cars
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### 4. ADMIN - POST car (очікуємо 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/cars
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "BMW",
  "model": "X5",
  "year": 2023
}

> {%
    client.global.set("adminCarId", response.body.id);
%}

### 5. ADMIN - PUT car (очікуємо 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/cars/{{adminCarId}}
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "BMW",
  "model": "X6",
  "year": 2024
}

### 6. ADMIN - DELETE car (очікуємо 403 Forbidden)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/cars/{{adminCarId}}
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### 7. SUPERUSER - POST car (очікуємо 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/cars
Authorization: Basic superuser super123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "RAV4",
  "year": 2024
}

> {%
    client.global.set("superuserCarId", response.body.id);
%}

### 8. SUPERUSER - PUT car (очікуємо 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/cars/{{superuserCarId}}
Authorization: Basic superuser super123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "Camry",
  "year": 2025
}

### 9. SUPERUSER - DELETE car (очікуємо 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/cars/{{superuserCarId}}
Authorization: Basic superuser super123

### 10. ANONYMOUS - GET cars (очікуємо 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:8080/cars
